This is a modified work. It is a Rust reimplementation derived from "throng" by Christopher Sebok
(Copyright (C) 2026 Christopher Sebok), which was released under the GNU Affero General Public
License v3.0. The original was a TypeScript/Electron application. This version rewrites it and
carries over its behavioural requirements, built-in theme palettes and theme derivation, default key
bindings, icon tokens, and the formats of its settings, theme, key binding and icon pack files.

Changes relative to the original, made from September 2026, in summary:
- the whole application was reimplemented in Rust, with a native user interface (egui) in place
  of Electron;
- Linux and macOS were added as supported platforms;
- the terminal daemon, persistence, editor and terminal emulator integration were rebuilt;
- the defects found in an audit of the original were designed out.
Every change since is recorded in this repository's version control.
